  "nodes": [
    {"id":"checkin","label":"Check-in","goal":"Three times a day, look at what changed in their workspace, mail and calendar, and text them only what can't wait; most looks stay quiet. Runs the front door with its own read-only tools and setup model.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":300,"ctx":["train:checkin"],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"graph/nodes/checkin.js · heartbeat.js","note":"","icon":"beat","kind":"input","model":"code","x":0,"y":60,"inSchema":[{"name":"timeZone","type":"text"},{"name":"since","type":"number","optional":true},{"name":"started","type":"number"}],"outSchema":[{"name":"to","type":"choice","options":"look, done"},{"name":"status","type":"number","optional":true},{"name":"body","type":"object","optional":true},{"name":"counts","type":"object","optional":true},{"name":"calendar","type":"yesno","optional":true}]},
    {"id":"routine","label":"Routine runs","goal":"Start a routine (a note under tex/routines/) on its schedule as a routine, not as a text: gather the routine, its past runs and when the person last reacted to or answered one, so Front door knows it's a routine, judges whether it is still relevant or stale, and asks the person whether to keep it when nobody has engaged with it.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":300,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"graph/nodes/routine.js · routine.js · runARoutine.js · finishARoutine.js","note":"","icon":"repeat","kind":"input","model":"code","x":0,"y":200,"outSchema":[{"name":"client","type":"text","optional":true},{"name":"texted","type":"yesno","optional":true},{"name":"claims","type":"yesno","optional":true},{"name":"tries","type":"yesno","optional":true},{"name":"forwarding","type":"number","optional":true},{"name":"pictures","type":"yesno","optional":true},{"name":"knowsStarted","type":"yesno","optional":true},{"name":"status","type":"number","optional":true},{"name":"answeredBy","type":"text","optional":true}]},
    {"id":"notify","label":"Send through Tex","goal":"Another AI connected to Context asks Tex to text the person (send notify) because something needs them now; their settings decide whether it goes, and it is texted as written, with no model.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":300,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"graph/nodes/notify.js · tools/attention.js · attention.js","note":"","icon":"plug","kind":"input","model":"code","x":840,"y":480,"inSchema":[{"name":"now","type":"number"},{"name":"timeZone","type":"text"}],"outSchema":[{"name":"to","type":"choice","options":"send, quiet"},{"name":"outcome","type":"choice","options":"speak, quiet, quiet_hours"},{"name":"answer","type":"text"},{"name":"count","type":"number"},{"name":"until","type":"number","optional":true}]},
    {"id":"text","label":"A text arrives","goal":"Take every text, picture or tapback from iMessage or WhatsApp and get it into the chat's record before anything decides about it.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":300,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"apps/agent","note":"","icon":"text","kind":"input","model":"code","x":0,"y":340,"group":"intake"},
    {"id":"oldLine","label":"Old number intake","goal":"When staff have switched Tex's old Sendblue line to redirect, a text that arrives on it takes no turn and gets one short reply naming the new number, at most once a day per chat (later texts that day are held); every other text goes on to Triage.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":60,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"graph/nodes/oldLine.js · apps/agent oldLineStep.ts · oldLine.ts","note":"","icon":"code","model":"code","x":840,"y":620,"inSchema":[{"name":"chatId","type":"text"},{"name":"mode","type":"choice","options":"off, redirect"},{"name":"number","type":"text","optional":true},{"name":"archiveOn","type":"text","optional":true},{"name":"lastToldAt","type":"number","optional":true},{"name":"now","type":"number"}],"outSchema":[{"name":"to","type":"choice","options":"redirect, hold, pass"},{"name":"answer","type":"text","optional":true}],"kind":"input"},
    {"id":"edit","label":"A text is edited or unsent","goal":"When someone edits or unsends a text they sent (iMessage Edit and Undo Send, on the Photon line; Sendblue sends neither), keep it in the chat beside the text it changes. An edit that changes nothing does nothing; any other edit goes on to Triage as a text of its own, marked as the edit, and Decide judges it from its examples (a fixed typo can go quiet, a changed ask gets its answer). An unsent text is kept as taken back and leaves the queue if Tex has not started on it, with no turn.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":60,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"graph/nodes/edit.js · textsEdit.js · apps/agent editStep.ts","note":"","icon":"text","kind":"input","model":"code","x":0,"y":180,"inSchema":[{"name":"kind","type":"choice","options":"one, group"},{"name":"change","type":"choice","options":"edit, unsend"},{"name":"words","type":"text","optional":true},{"name":"earlier","type":"text","optional":true}],"outSchema":[{"name":"to","type":"choice","options":"turn, same, withdraw"},{"name":"why","type":"text"}],"group":"intake"},
    {"id":"moveChat","label":"Staff move a chat","goal":"Staff move one chat at a time to Tex's new number from the console (Platform → Lines); once a minute the texting Worker takes the moves asked for, and this words the one text the old line sends: a person is told to text the new number from now on, a group that Tex is swapping numbers. A group first gets the new number added (Sendblue), then the note from the old number; when the new line hears that note among the same people (read from the bridge, since its event names only the sender) it ties the two groups together, so the group keeps its home and memory, and takes the old number out. No model; with no new number saved, nothing is sent.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":60,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"graph/nodes/moveChat.js · textsMove.js · apps/agent moveChats.ts · groupMoves.ts","note":"","icon":"code","kind":"input","model":"code","x":1540,"y":440,"inSchema":[{"name":"kind","type":"choice","options":"person, group"},{"name":"number","type":"text","optional":true},{"name":"archiveOn","type":"text","optional":true}],"outSchema":[{"name":"to","type":"choice","options":"person, group, skip"},{"name":"text","type":"text","optional":true}],"group":"staff-messages"},
    {"id":"triage","label":"Triage","goal":"Code's rules before any judge: one text with nothing of Tex's waiting on it, a command, a setting or a yes code goes straight to the queue; several texts, a bare thanks, or a text that may leave an ask behind goes to Decide. In a group, a command said to Tex goes straight on, and every other line goes to Decide.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":60,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"inboxTurn.ts chooseTurn · groupInbox.ts acceptGroup","note":"","icon":"code","model":"code","outSchema":[{"name":"to","type":"choice","options":"tex, judge, running"},{"name":"why","type":"text","options":"the rule that sent it"}],"x":0,"y":400,"group":"intake"},
    {"id":"decide","label":"Decide","goal":"Choose, from labelled examples, whether this text gets an answer, a reaction, a short wait or nothing, so Tex never answers what wasn't for it. A wait the chat doesn't hold is judged again with only quiet or answer to choose.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":2,"out":40,"ctx":["train:decide","recent","groupBrief","date"],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":["respond"],"file":"textsDecide.js · textDecide.cjs","note":"","icon":"judge","model":"clef","outSchema":[{"name":"act","type":"choice","options":"quiet, respond, wait"},{"name":"also_react","type":"yesno"},{"name":"wait_seconds","type":"score","options":"1-10"},{"name":"moved_on","type":"yesno"},{"name":"emoji","type":"choice","options":"one per reaction"},{"name":"why","type":"choice","options":"the examples' reasons"}],"x":220,"y":230,"group":"intake"},
    {"id":"decideWhy","label":"Decide's reason","goal":"When Decide stays quiet, or only reacts, for a reason that says the message is for Tex, ask once more for the reason alone, told the act, from only the reasons a quiet message can have. The act never changes.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":10,"ctx":[],"ms":0,"timeoutS":0,"areas":["respond"],"file":"graph/nodes/decideWhy.js · textDecide.cjs","note":"On since 2026-11-18: Training kept Decide at 24/27 and Dev's Decide went 18 to 19 of 23 (Lab runs v57pwqb6, v57npa0q).","icon":"judge","model":"clef","inSchema":[{"name":"act","type":"choice","options":"quiet, react"},{"name":"why","type":"choice","options":"a reason that says it is for Tex"}],"outSchema":[{"name":"to","type":"choice","options":"kept, changed"},{"name":"why","type":"choice","options":"the reasons a quiet message can have"}],"x":1120,"y":230,"group":"tools-subagents"},
    {"id":"lanes","label":"Queue","goal":"Keep one turn per chat at a time (groups up to three side by side) so two answers never race each other.","log":false,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":300,"ctx":[],"ms":1000,"timeoutS":0,"areas":[],"file":"apps/agent inbox.ts · groupTurn.ts","note":"","icon":"queue","model":"code","x":220,"y":430,"group":"intake"},
    {"label":"Router","goal":"Beside the Door, Clef picks the specialist front door for this turn, fed the Shape gate's read and the context modules its config names (its Training examples, the chat's history, what Tex is doing now, the date): quick (no tools), read (read-only tools), act (write tools and the yes-code confirm), or job (long work, to the Hand-off). Not sure, or a door that reaches past its tools: today's Front door answers.","log":true,"on":true,"rounds":1,"out":20,"ctx":["train:router","recent","groupBrief","date"],"ms":0,"timeoutS":3,"areas":["core"],"file":"graph/nodes/router.js · specialistRoute.js · doorTools.js","note":"On as a logged signal only (Dev2, 2026-11-20): no door or hand-off reads it, so the turn never waits on it; scored against what each turn did.","icon":"router","model":"clef","x":0,"y":0,"group":"tools-subagents","id":"router","inSchema":[{"name":"question","type":"text"},{"name":"group","type":"yesno"},{"name":"trigger","type":"choice","options":"text, checkin, routine","optional":true},{"name":"shape","type":"object","optional":true}],"outSchema":[{"name":"route","type":"choice","options":"quick, read, act, job, none"},{"name":"sure","type":"number","optional":true}]},
